1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:04,450
At the little mill, her harvest
begins its transformation.

2
00:00:04,650 --> 00:00:10,850
A wave of her wand sends the cherries tumbling
into the pulper, revealing the beans inside.

3
00:00:12,250 --> 00:00:14,850
Spread beneath the sunshine, they dry.

4
00:00:15,650 --> 00:00:19,150
Then, a little fire turns them
warm and golden brown.

5
00:00:21,050 --> 00:00:25,450
She turns the grinder’s handle, filling the
air with the comforting scent of coffee.

6
00:00:29,050 --> 00:00:34,350
With the precious grounds tucked safely
away, she climbs towards the clouds.

7
00:00:35,050 --> 00:00:37,650
One last touch of magic awaits.
